"node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDUzYjdjZjVjMmU3NzI0MGY0Mjk3ODZkOGFkNzhjNTcwY2JiY2IzNTU","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/53b7cf5c2e77240f429786d8ad78c570cbbcb355","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/53b7cf5c2e77240f429786d8ad78c570cbbcb355","author":{"name":"Dusty Mabe","email":"dusty@dustymabe.com","date":"2025-11-21T19:53:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"Dusty Mabe","email":"dusty@dustymabe.com","date":"2025-12-08T13:42:35Z"},"tree":{"sha":"3af432810bd7b7f02c44eb75aa889abe7e6bf0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/3af432810bd7b7f02c44eb75aa889abe7e6bf0c6"},"message":"hscontrol: log acme/autocert errors\n\nMy ACME renewals weren't working at all and I had no idea why from\nlooking at the logs of headscale today. This ListenAndServe() seems\nto not be outputting any logs from the `go func()`.\n\nIf I added some debug logging via `Environment=GODEBUG=http2debug=1`\nI could see more information:\n\n```\n2025/11/21 13:11:01 http2: Transport received DATA flags=END_STREAM stream=103 len=520 data=\"{\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"urn:ietf:params:acme:error:rateLimited\\\",\\n  \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Your account is temporarily prevented from requesting certificates for <redacted>.com and possibly others. Please visit: https://portal.letsencrypt.org/sfe/v1/unpause?jwt=123456789\" (264 bytes omitted)\n```\n\nbut as you can see `(264 bytes omitted)` from [1] made the message\nunactionable for me because it chopped off the unique ID I was\nsupposed to use to unpause my ratelimiting.\n\nLet's add add some middleware via http.RoundTripper to get the approprate\nlog messages to help me understand what was going on. This is the\nresulting message I see:\n\n```\n2025-11-21T15:59:19-05:00 ERR ACME request returned error body=\"{\\n  \\\"type\\\": \\\"urn:ietf:params:acme:error:rateLimited\\\",\\n  \\\"detail\\\": \\\"Your account is temporarily prevented from requesting certificates for <redacted>.com and possibly others. Please visit: https://portal.letsencrypt.org/sfe/v1/unpause?jwt=0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": 429\\n}\" status_code=429 url=https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/acme/new-order\n```\n\nAssisted-By: <google/gemini-3-pro-preview>\n\nFixes: https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/2911\n\n[1] https://cs.opensource.google/go/go/+/master:src/net/http/h2_bundle.go;l=3274;drc=4b0e3cc1d63a00ee184ea1f6b17e79808e3d9fdc","parents":[{"sha":"6359511a626a3ff549ce7d32c14c5cf12082fe60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6359511a626a3ff549ce7d32c14c5cf12082fe60","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6359511a626a3ff549ce7d32c14c5cf12082fe60"}],"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQJIBAABCAAyFiEEPb6zG5c6sV89tRYPMwLb1zlS5nEFAmk21c0UHGR1c3R5QGR1\nc3R5bWFiZS5jb20ACgkQMwLb1zlS5nGhIA//cWXAGwTn+4+gDEesowp8bZ1/yKQ4\nnSjOnRo9lWqMmsPgXyoi50VaopTBMgrGyC/T/XW+zgHQk3ppQAKku2VE7PY6MsSD\ndot2NM3PaR9oSBQektwV9JUO8+WgQZvFSulRaiXx98aKH9MD4+MfHnczP5/4xwM2\nx03n3nuOYuhO8ia6IgAwuKoYPKttlDUo1dlBdv5u9QmJgj3n25T888TAUQ344nTF\npEK1S4AiWMME3A9D9cR9d6lrCqQTwXQs2Edo808vQ/+eiJVXtmTj9NdjLMkmkjJa\nS58inFqMg7Ka+ut4o84r6MWSp0Lk9RX87yEhVu6H5bBhMXYc4LUpd143cUZQCecZ\nAtsRTFzybz1pqNCCbi/RltwqacMbrbMW4wOF4Vhy5oTY0lgdhNTTBC9g10QUi2Y3\n9/EddmVKF9B+V+GQnW4b16liPJEQZHKsa+YcepjktqlZYAabGKM0NEkohXK8ztbA\nptQw2QudSvX3gYK6mtBJwM+sPvNck8ETHhEvLl+Yu6DGqRSlktUQGUaaec9rL/Hp\nwHk/1j66DsK9ESbZliBvcYIn5NlwaO4PAbkV5/GmaNTOhFKZFU1pmXgCbzZ8B1Hy\nM3+kywTWkn57Vogx9XDWlJVrbkV1V8/amwb++lKe4II6Cj03eEfVH5bYRDihCla2\nNiZ6xf69nHOc2rg=\n=s7Vq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","payload":"tree 3af432810bd7b7f02c44eb75aa889abe7e6bf0c6\nparent 6359511a626a3ff549ce7d32c14c5cf12082fe60\nauthor Dus